\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indian bond yields rise after auction; RBI key\b0\par\par\uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2012\par 15:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Aggressive bidding pushes down bond prices\par \par \uc2 * Oil, global risk aversion key to outlook\par \par \uc2 * RBI seen purchasing more bonds via OMOs-analyst\par \par \uc2 (Updates to mention RBI deputy governor's comments earlier in the day)\par \par \uc2 By Swati Bhat\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, May 18 (Reuters) - Indian federal bond yields rose on Friday as investors trimmed positions following aggressive bidding at the auction earlier in the day but global risk aversion and slumping oil prices are expected to help support debt prices.\par \par \uc2 India sold 150 billion rupees ($2.75 billion) in bonds on Friday, with the auction fully subscribed and at lower coupons than expected by a Reuters poll of traders.\par \par \uc2 The auction offset a day in which Greece's political problems continued, pummelling risk assets globally and pushing down Brent crude to its lowest in 2012, both factors that are expected to influence debt markets next week.\par \par \uc2 Liquidity will also be a key factor, as the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to step up its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, with the rupee falling to a record low of 54.91 during the session, but settling at 54.42/44 at the close.\par \par \uc2 A deputy governor at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday the RBI will continue to use a mix of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and administrative steps to protect the rupee.\par \par \uc2 However, the RBI is expected to offset the impact on rupee liquidity from its suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  with bond purchases in the form of open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  (OMOs).\par \par \uc2 "Crude prices have come down, and at the same time there are expectations of further OMOs to support bond auctions which is supporting market yields," a debt fund manager at a brokerage said.\par \par \uc2 The benchmark 10-year bond ended at 8.53 percent, 4 basis points higher than Thursday's close.\par \par \uc2 However, yields ended the week down 3 basis points, which analysts attributed to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's OMO announced on Monday, its second such debt purchase in as many weeks.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought back 111.3 billion rupees in bonds on Friday, lower than the notified 120 billion rupees.\par \par \uc2 "Further open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  will depend on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by RBI. I think OMO should happen next week and, in my view, two more weeks at least," said Manish Wadhawan, managing direction and head of interest rates at HSBC India.\par \par \uc2 One-year OIS rate closed down 3 basis points at 7.97 percent, while the five-year rate fell 2 bps to 7.42 percent.\par \par \uc2 Front-end OIS rates fell more due some easing in the domestic cash conditions.\par \par \uc2 Repo borrowings reached 430 billion rupees in the afternoon auction and 532 billion rupees in the morning, marking the fourth consecutive session it has fallen below the 1 trillion rupee mark and within the RBI's comfort zone.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been conducting two such \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on reserves reporting day in recent months.\par \par \uc2 ($1 = 54.5550 Indian rupees)\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Rafael Nam)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-BONDS/ (CLOSER) (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | SNI | SNS | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120518e85i000tv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
