\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Is A Losing Proposition - CLSA\b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Mai 2012\par 12:43\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 1043 GMT [Dow Jones] The INR, which has been consistently weakening against the USD to touch a fresh all-time low of Wednesday, will see its path affected by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says Rajeev Malik, economist at CLSA. This, he says, is apart from the interplay of global risk, crude oil price and volatile capital inflows. The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent depreciation, if economic fundamentals favour it, is a losing proposition," Malik says in a note. "Such an approach could leave the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a combination of lower foreign reserves and still-weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and could also be an invitation for a speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Thus, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation is part of the solution, not part of the problem," he adds. CLSA forecasts the USD/INR at 55 by December.\par \par \uc2  The INR has depreciated around 22% since early August 2011--this is slightly more that the size of devaluation in 1991 even though India has not had a "crisis" this time, Malik notes.(khushita.vasant@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 17-05-12 1043GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1012 1085 1164 5064 55106 62506 75112   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120517e85h000nm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40