\par\par \b \uc2 Indian bond yields at 2-wk low on liquidity hopes\b0\par\par\uc2 By Archana Narayanan   \par \uc2 366 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2012\par 14:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, May 8 (Reuters) - India's 10-year federal bond yield eased to its lowest in more than two weeks on Tuesday on hopes liquidity would improve as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to buy debt through open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  later this week.\par \par \uc2 Liquidity has been a key concern in debt markets, especially now that the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is suspected to be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets by selling dollars.\par \par \uc2 In a reflection of the cash crunch, India's repo borrowings have stayed above 1 trillion rupees mark for nine of the past 11 sessions.\par \par \uc2 The prospect of OMOs, announced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, offset the worries seen in India's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stock market amid fears that the government had not fully addressed the concerns over taxation for foreign investors.\par \par \uc2 "Constant \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has exacerbated the liquidity crunch, pushing up the bond yields. The OMO announcement and RBI statement have provided assurance to the markets of continued liquidity infusion from this route," said Anuj Tagra, a dealer with \uc2 Union Bank of India\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The benchmark 8.79 percent 2021 bond closed at 8.54 percent, a level last seen on April 23. It closed at 8.69 percent on Monday.\par \par \uc2 Traders are also anticipating the unveiling of a new 10-year bond benchmark, though India is not likely to issue a new 10-year debt at its scheduled auction on Friday, sources told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 "With a fortnightly time lag for introduction of new 10 year benchmark and frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the movement in yield would be driven by RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  either through secondary market purchases or OMO," said Shakti Satapathy, a fixed income analyst with AK Capital Services.\par \par \uc2 Despite the RBI's OMO announcement, the swap market remained concerned about persistent liquidity pressures and the muted prospect of interest rate cuts.\par \par \uc2 India's 1-year OIS rate and the 5-year OIS\par \par \uc2 were down 1 basis points each at 8.01 percent and\par \par \uc2 7.51 percent, respectively.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Rafael Nam)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS INDIA/BONDS | ABN | D | M | RBN | SNI | SNS | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120508e8580010c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
