 recover from a low of more than two months, four dealers said. The dollar was at INR51.17 late Thursday in Asia, after touching a high of INR51.26.\par \par \uc2 Speaking to reporters on the sidelines of an event, Chakrabarty said the liquidity situation in the banking system will remain tight until inflation declines to a very low level.\par \par \uc2 -By Khushita Vasant; Dow Jones Newswires; +91-22-61456117; nupur.acharya@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 22, 2012 10:32 ET (14:32 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120322e83m004ff\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
