\par\par \b \uc2 3rd UPDATE: India  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  May Consider Rolling Back  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Trading Curbs - Official\b0\par\par\uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Februar 2012\par 15:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Deputy governor says trading restrictions are imposing costs on some market participants\par \par \uc2 -- U.S. dollar falls to its lowest in three months against Indian rupee\par \par \uc2 -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  asks banks to consider cap on clients' unhedged \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure\par \par \uc2 -- Best to be unpredictable about tactical \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  management, says governor\par \par \uc2 (Recasts the first paragraph, adds details and context in 2nd to 4th paragraphs)\par \par \uc2 By Nupur Acharya and Sudeep Jain\par \par \uc2 Of \uc2 DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 )--The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  may consider rolling back recently imposed restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading once markets stabilize, a top \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said Thursday, as the rupee surged to a three-month high against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The trading curbs were imposing costs on some market participants and run counter to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's broad strategy of having "robust, vibrant" \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, RBI Deputy Governor Subir Gokarn told television channel Bloomberg UTV.\par \par \uc2 In December, the RBI placed limits on unhedged foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions that banks can hold overnight and also banned firms from cancelling and rebooking forward contracts, as part of measures to prop up the rupee.\par \par \uc2 Gokarn, however, declined to give a timeline for reversing the measures, saying that would be a matter of "very fine judgement as to whether the situation has stabilized or not."\par \par \uc2 The comments come as the rupee has risen more than 8% this year against the U.S. dollar after tumbling about 16% in 2011. The local unit has been boosted by a surge in foreign fund flows into local equities and debt, apart from the RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the curbs on speculative trading.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has taken a series of measures to attract overseas capital such as raising the cap on foreign investment in local bonds and allowing banks to freely set interest rates on deposits received from non-resident Indians.\par \par \uc2 The dollar was at INR49.15 late Thursday in Asia after dropping to a three-month low of INR48.95 earlier in the day.\par \par \uc2 However, foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure of Indian firms remains a concern, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday asking banks to consider framing policies to limit the unhedged foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure of their clients.\par \par \uc2 Banks should also price the risk arising from unhedged foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure into credit premiums, the RBI said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Local media reports have speculated that only 40% of Indian corporations' foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt is hedged. That means a sharp fluctuation in the exchange rate could lead to steep credit losses.\par \par \uc2 Separately, RBI Governor Duvvuri Subbarao Thursday reiterated the bank's policy of keeping mum about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "It pays to be a bit unpredictable on when you \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , how much you \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , how you are going to move the exchange rate," he said at a conference.\par \par \uc2 The RBI recently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to prop up the rupee, with its dollar sales rising to a 32-month high of $2.9 billion in November.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is published after a lag, and the RBI has a long-stated policy of getting into the market only to manage excessive volatility.\par \par \uc2 --By Nupur Acharya and Sudeep Jain, \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\uc2 ; +91-11-43563311; anant.kala@dowjones.com [ 02-02-12 1423GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120202e8220014x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
