\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: RBI Governor Subbarao: Best To Be Unpredictable In  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Management\b0\par\par\uc2 574 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Februar 2012\par 10:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Best to be unpredictable about tactical \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  management, says governor\par \par \uc2 -- Strategic policies on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  management must be clear and stable\par \par \uc2 -- U.S. dollar falls to its weakest in three months against Indian rupee\par \par \uc2 (Adds governor's comments in 10th and 11th paragraphs, context in 5th and 12th paragraphs, rupee move in 6th paragraph)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par   By Nupur Acharya and Sudeep Jain \par   Of \f28 \uc2 \f2 DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI (\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 )--India's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Thursday said it is best to be unpredictable in tactical \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  management, reiterating the bank's policy of not disclosing details of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "It pays to be a bit unpredictable on when you \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , how much you \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , how you are going to move the exchange rate," Duvvuri Subbarao said at a conference.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  recently \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets to prop up the rupee, with its dollar sales rising to a 32-month high of $2.9 billion in November.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  data on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is published after a lag, and the RBI has a long-stated policy of getting into the market only to manage excessive volatility.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The rupee, Asia's worst-performing major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in 2011, has risen about 8% in 2012 against the U.S. dollar on the back of foreign fund flows into local equity and debt, apart from the RBI's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and imposing of new curbs on speculative trading.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has taken a series of measures to attract overseas capital such as raising the cap on foreign investments allowed in local bonds, as well as the total costs that companies are permitted to incur to raise overseas loans.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Also, the RBI has allowed banks to freely set interest rates on deposits received from non-resident Indians.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 These measures have helped revive capital inflows and boost the rupee.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar fell to INR48.95, a three-month low, intraday Thursday. It was trading at INR49.05 at 0830 GMT.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 While the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may remain discreet about its market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Subbarao said strategic policies on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  management should be clearly laid out in the public domain and remain stable over time.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Also, it is difficult for the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's monetary policy steps--such as rate increases--to control inflation when the fiscal deficit is wide.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's fiscal deficit is expected to overshoot the government's target of 4.6% of gross domestic product for the current fiscal year through March by as much as one percentage point. While government spending has remained high in the run-up to elections in five states this year, tax revenue has taken a hit due to a slowing economy.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's policy tightening has helped pull down inflation, but it still remains uncomfortably high because heavy government spending continues to stoke demand.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Besides, rising growth worries have forced the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to end the current tightening cycle.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Subbarao added: "It is unrealistic that the Reserve Bank pursue inflation target completely oblivious of other objectives, [of which] most important is growth."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The RBI has aggressively tightened monetary policy since March 2010 to bring spiraling prices under control. But this has choked industrial activity, forcing the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to shift to a growth-supportive policy stance.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par   --By Nupur Acharya and Sudeep Jain, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \uc2 \f2 ; +91-11-43563311; anant.kala@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 02-02-12 0948GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120202e822000rz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
