\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  may  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in forward market-source\b0\par\par\uc2 464 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 2012\par 08:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, background)\par \par \uc2 Jan 27 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, in addition to the spot market, to help manage liquidity in the banking system, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  source said on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since September to stem the rupee's fall. The rupee fell nearly 16 percent in 2011, making it one of the worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world.\par \par \uc2 It has, however, recovered smartly in 2012, gaining nearly 6 percent so far, helped by renewed flows in equity as well as large inflows into debt.\par \par \uc2 "If and when we are doing it (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), we may do a combination of spot and forwards, so liquidity impact is shifted to a future date," the source said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been active in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent months, in a bid to prop up the rupee. Traders have routinely suspected the RBI's hand in the market, specially in late hours of trade.\par \par \uc2 The official \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data comes with a month's lag. The RBI sold $2.92 billion in the spot market in November, its biggest sale of dollars in over two-and-half years.\par \par \uc2 Net outstanding sales stood at $1.62 billion in the forward market in November, the first time the RBI has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the segment in over a year.\par \par \uc2 Wednesday, RBI deputy governor H.R. Khan said that any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as and when it happens, will be a combination of both cash as well as forward basis.\par \par \uc2 "But there is a limit upto which you can do forward because then the premiums will disturb other rates," he said, adding the amount is decided based on the market condition.\par \par \uc2 Banks borrowed 1.59 trillion rupees ($32.1 billion) from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's repo window on Friday, compared with 1.45 trillion rupees on Wednesday, and significantly higher than the RBI's comfort zone of 600 billion rupees, indicating the tightness in liquidity.\par \par \uc2 Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  slashed its cash reserve ratio by 50 basis points to inject 320 billion rupees in the banking system. The cut will be effective Saturday. In addition, it has bought 700 billion rupees of bonds since Nov. to support the government's large borrowing programme.\par \par \uc2 At 2:45 p.m. (0915 GMT), the rupee was at 49.46/4650 to the dollar, after touching 49.44, its highest since Nov. 9, and firmer than 50.09/10 at close on Wednesday. The market was closed on Thursday for a local holiday.\par \par \uc2 ($1=49.5)\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Shamik Paul in MUMBAI; Editing by Subhadip Sircar)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-RBI/ RUPEE (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120130e81r000k0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
