\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ India  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 's Gokarn: Will Respond Strongly To Any Sharp One-Way Moves In Rupee\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2012\par 06:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: Indian Rupee Is Stabilizing\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Is Always An Option\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: Don't See Any Balance Of Payments Problems\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: Capital Inflows May Stay Subdued\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: Liquidity Tight But Not In Stress\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:33 EDT *DJ  RBI Gokarn: Money Market Rates Are Within Liquidity Adjustment Facility Corridor\par \par \uc2 5 Jan 2012 00:55 EDT DJ  India \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Gokarn: Will Respond Strongly To Any Sharp One-Way Moves In Rupee\par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stands ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to smooth any sharp moves in the rupee, which is expected to stabilize now after falling sharply last year, a senior \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  official said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We will respond strongly to any sharp one-way moves (in the rupee)," Subir Gokarn, deputy governor of the RBI, said in an interview in Singapore.\par \par \uc2 He also said that recent measures such as raising deposit rates for non-resident Indians and restrictions on hedging contracts have helped stabilize the exchange rate and the current movement reflects fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 -By Gaurav Raghuvanshi; Dow Jones Newswires; +65 64154 154; gaurav.raghuvanshi@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 05, 2012 00:55 ET (05:55 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120105e815001a4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
